      "html": "<summary class=\"details__summary flex items-center justify-between gap-2 cursor-pointer\" style=\"color: #ffffff; list-style: none; outline: none;\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n          <svg class=\"icon icon-md\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n            <rect x=\"5\" y=\"2\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n            <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"text-sm-base font-medium leading-none\" style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">Miroooo Smile Coach App</span>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"icon icon-chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n          <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"details__content text-sm\" style=\"margin-top: 12px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\">\n          Miroooo Smile Coach is your free, browser-based personal brushing companion designed specifically for Miroooo X2. It builds a tailored 28-day routine around your dental goals—featuring interactive 2-minute guided brushing sessions, 30-second quadrant pacing cues, morning and evening habit tracking, and DuPont brush-head replacement reminders.\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\">\n          100% private and account-free: all your progress is saved locally to your device with zero sign-up or app store downloads required. Open the web app anytime on mobile or desktop to master consistent, dentist-grade brushing technique.\n        </p>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n          <style>\n            .smile-coach-btn:hover .btn-text,\n            .smile-coach-btn.is-hovered .btn-text {\n              color: #ffffff !important;\n            }\n            .smile-coach-btn:hover .btn-text svg,\n            .smile-coach-btn.is-hovered .btn-text svg {\n              color: #ffffff !important;\n              stroke: #ffffff !important;\n              fill: none !important;\n            }\n            .smile-coach-btn:hover .btn-text svg path,\n            .smile-coach-btn.is-hovered .btn-text svg path {\n              stroke: #ffffff !important;\n            }\n            .smile-coach-btn:hover .btn-fill,\n            .smile-coach-btn.is-hovered .btn-fill {\n              transform: translate3d(0, 0%, 0) !important;\n            }\n          </style>\n          <a href=\"/pages/smile-coach\" class=\"button button--primary smile-coach-btn\" is=\"hover-button\">\n            <span class=\"btn-fill\" data-fill></span>\n            <span class=\"btn-text\">\n              Open Smile Coach\n              <svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
